Error [jet.InvalidRoute]: HTTPRouter route path must be a static String
  --> http_route_constant_path.jet:13:16
    |
 13 |     router.get(path, handle)
    |                ^^^^
 Why: Router endpoint contracts are fully checked while building; mux value routes may be computed at runtime
 Fix: Use a literal or compile-time String constant, or register the dynamic route on a mux
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2805
